My standard ascension kit doesn't include many rings..

- Free action. Once I have it identified, I keep it in my right ring
  finger most of the time. I may take it off on the air level so that I
  can wear levitation + conflict or levitation + rengeneration. Or
  occasionally when I try out more unidentified rings.

- Levitation. My favorite means of levitation, to be used when needed.

- Conflict, mainly worn sometimes in the Sanctum, Air and Astral when I
  feel like it. Not constantly, and I can live (or die) without it.

- Regeneration, occasionally worn when there are many nasties around close
  to me. But I generally don't use a wish for this one..

